<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#TestData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Data used to assess the performance of a final model."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Cloud> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An AI system running on cloud infrastructure."@en .
